 "title": "Copy the Formula, Not the Content",
 "topic": "content creation",
 "summary": "The creator explains how he analyzed Think School's top-performing long-form videos to reverse-engineer their research and scripting framework. By applying their formula to his own creative style, he managed to get over 25,000 views on a two-minute value-driven video.",
 "key_points": [
  "To make good content, you need to know how to copy.",
  "Step 1: Take transcriptions of the recent 200 videos from a successful channel like Think School.",
  "Step 2: Fully analyze the transcriptions to decode their content strategy, research pattern, and scripting structure.",
  "Step 3: Mix the analyzed formula with your own creativity to make your reel.",
  "Results achieved from this method: 25,860 views, 21,424 viewers, 37 seconds average watch time, and 86 followers on a single video.",
  "This was a 2-minute video based purely on value without any entertainment.",
  "The creator's core lesson: \"Copy the formula, not the content.\""
 ],
 "content": "Content creation pannanum, adhum nalla content pannanum na, first copy adikka therinjirkanum. Ippo enna kadha nu paatheengana, adhan pa indha business case study videos ellam poduvangale, suppose ivanga videos ellam paathiralam paarunga semmaya irukkum. So enakku oru project vandhuchu, adhu enna na Think School-oda long-form videos-ah analyse panni, avangaloda research pattern-ayum scripting structure-ayum kandu pudikanum. Ippo enna, content analyse pannanum, avlodhana nu ketan, ama nu sonnanga. Adhukku na enna theriyuma sonnen? Summa guess pannunga, summa guess pannunga. Na dhanda specialist da. Joke joke, illai. Ok ok, nagaichuvai podhum. Ippo na enna enna pannen nu soldren. First, Think School post panna recent 200 videos-oda ella transcription-um eduthen. Second-u, avanga transcription-a full-a analyse panni, avanga content strategy, research pattern, scripting structure nu ellathayum decode pannen. Analyse panna formula-va ennoda creativity-oda vechi oru mixing-ah pottu reel-ayum panni mudichen. Result enna theriyuma? 25K views and 80 plus followers in a single video. Enna bro avan avan 1M adikkan, ippo poi 25K perusa pesitu iruka nu sila peruku thonalam. Anga dhaan oru vishayame therinjikkanum. Idhu 2 nimisham video, adhu full-a value vechi matume eludhuna content, edhndha oru entertainment-um illa idhula. And indha channel-la recent-ah potta ella videos-um 3K 4K views-nu poitu irundhuchu, indha video dhaan 25K views poirukku. Ippo sollunga, idhu oru win dhana? So na first-e sonna maari copy adikanum dhan, ana content illa, formula-va. COPY THE FORMULA, NOT THE CONTENT - Sree.",
